<title>UK: KFW unit prices $500 million 10-year bond, +20 bp.</title>
<headline>KFW unit prices $500 million 10-year bond, +20 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier has been priced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> $500 MLN		 COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    06.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.441    PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    99.441    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US,UK,DE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NY	  HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125 BP  SELL CONC  0.2</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT 2007 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
